graph LR
    A[Low Effort<br>Low Output] --> B[Optimal Zone<br>(Peak Efficiency)]
    B --> C[High Effort<br>Falling Output]

    A:::low --> B:::peak
    B:::peak --> C:::decline

    classDef low fill:#b0b0b0,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef peak fill:#00c8c8,stroke:#0ff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef decline fill:#ff7070,stroke:#f00,stroke-width:1px;
